@q 6:71-74

@table
Levied by the Union | Levied by the States | Local bodies
**Income tax** (non-agricultural), **corporation tax**, **customs**, central excise, **CGST/IGST** | **Agricultural income tax**, **land revenue**, **excise on liquor**, stamp duty, **SGST**, motor vehicle (**road**) tax, electricity duty, entertainment tax (outside GST) | Property tax, **tax on fairs**, water and sanitation charges, octroi (old)
@end

**Corporation tax** is the tax on company profits; **MAT** (minimum alternate tax) and the old **fringe benefit tax** (2005-2009) also fall on companies. Capital gains tax applies to individuals as well, so it is not specific to the corporate sector.

