@table
Tax | Fact
**MODVAT** | **1986**; credit for excise paid on inputs
**CENVAT** | **2000-01**; MODVAT renamed, extended to capital goods
**VAT** | **Multi-stage** tax on value added at each stage; **Haryana first (2003)**; national roll-out **1 April 2005**; **UP adopted it 1 January 2008**, Chhattisgarh 2006
**Service tax** | **1994-95** (Chelliah committee idea), an **indirect** tax at 5% on 3 services; merged into GST
@end

