@up UP link: UP's panchayats are funded by **Central Finance Commission grants**, the **UP State Finance Commission**, centrally sponsored schemes and their own taxes (fairs, markets). UP is the largest receiver of Central tax devolution (about 18%). UP adopted **VAT on 1 January 2008**.

