@heatmap

@pattern
Taxation is asked every year. Old papers asked which tax is direct and who levies it; the **2016-2025** papers moved to **GST** (amendment, council, ITC, RNR) and **Finance Commission chairmen**. A chairman-match question appeared as recently as 2025.
@end

@next
Likely next angles: **GST 2.0** slabs and the end of the compensation cess, the **16th Finance Commission's** criteria (contribution to GDP), the **Income-tax Act 2025**, the **Rs. 12 lakh** rebate, and **UP's** share of devolution.
@end
